WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.302
- UH, GREETINGS,
ADVENTURERS.

00:00:03.335 --> 00:00:06.039
- GREETINGS.
- GREETINGS.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:07.473
- AS YOU ALL
CAN SEE HERE,

00:00:07.506 --> 00:00:09.776
WE HAVE A NEW TRAVELER
IN OUR RANKS.

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:11.677
UH, THIS IS
MY COUSIN TYRELL,

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:15.615
AND HE WILL BE CONTROLLING
THE PLAYER CHARACTER.

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:18.785
- HIS NAME IS KANYE.
HE'S A GIANT, YO.

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:22.155
- [nervously laughing]
UH, DEAR COUSIN...

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:25.391
TRADITIONALLY, A--A GIANT
IS NOT ASSUMED BY A PLAYER.

00:00:25.424 --> 00:00:27.160
IT IS A
CHAOTIC, EVIL--

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:30.396
- YEAH, BUT I WANNA
BE A GIANT, YO.

00:00:30.429 --> 00:00:32.432
ALL BIG.

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:35.768
- OH, OKAY. FINE.
[laughing]

00:00:35.801 --> 00:00:38.337
WELL, TRAVELERS, YOU ARE JOINED
ON YOUR ADVENTURE TODAY

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:42.375
BY A GIANT
NAMED KANYE.

00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:45.578
NOW WHEN LAST WE LEFT YOU,
YOU WERE AT THE INN

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:48.281
OF THE NORTH STAR
IN THE TOWN OF ISLEDOR.

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:49.649
HOW DO YOU BEGIN
YOUR ADVENTURE?

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.751
- I WANNA GET
SOME BITCHES.

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:53.786
WHERE THE CLUB AT
AT ISLEDOR, YO?

00:00:53.819 --> 00:00:55.588
- TYRELL, THIS IS
HIGHLY UNUSUAL.

00:00:55.621 --> 00:00:57.190
I THINK THE GUYS PROBABLY
JUST WANNA GO ON THE QUEST--

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:58.724
- UM, STEPHEN?
- YES?

00:00:58.757 --> 00:01:01.194
- I WOULD LIKE TO JOIN
KANYE THE GIANT IN HIS QUEST.

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:03.163
- SERIOUSLY?

00:01:05.431 --> 00:01:06.799
ALL RIGHT.

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:09.569
THE TWO OF YOU
ENTER THE TAVERN.

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:11.204
WHAT DO YOU SAY?

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:13.372
- KANYE THE GIANT
ORDERS ALIZE.

00:01:13.405 --> 00:01:15.374
- HMM, SAYS
THE BARKEEP.

00:01:15.407 --> 00:01:18.211
UH, I KNOW NOT OF THIS FOREIGN
BEVERAGE OF WHICH YOU SPEAK.

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:20.379
PERHAPS YOU'D ENJOY
AN ELVEN ALE?

00:01:20.412 --> 00:01:21.848
- NO, WE BOTH
WANT THE ALIZE.

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:23.549
- ALIZE DOES NOT EXIST
IN THIS WORLD.

00:01:23.582 --> 00:01:25.485
- KANYE THE GIANT
SLAPS THAT BITCH.

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:27.286
- OH!

00:01:27.319 --> 00:01:30.156
- KANYE THE GIANT ATTEMPTS
TO SLAP THE BARTENDER. HERE.

00:01:30.189 --> 00:01:31.891
THE BARTENDER
IS HALF-HOBBIT

00:01:31.924 --> 00:01:33.826
AND VERY NIMBLE,

00:01:33.859 --> 00:01:36.162
SO YOU'RE GOING TO HAVE
TO ROLL AN 18 OR ABOVE TO HIT.

00:01:36.195 --> 00:01:37.630
20.
- BLIP.

00:01:37.663 --> 00:01:39.332
SLAP THAT HOBBIT'S
[bleep] OFF, YO.

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:41.601
- OKAY. GOLLIN
THE CLERIC,

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:44.570
WOULD YOU CARE TO RESTRAIN
KANYE THE GIANT

00:01:44.603 --> 00:01:46.339
BEFORE THE TOWN GUARD
IS CALLED?

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:48.374
- UH, I GRAB MONEY
OUT OF THE REGISTER.

00:01:48.407 --> 00:01:50.476
- BUT--BUT--BUT GOLLIN
THE CLERIC IS LAWFUL GOOD.

00:01:50.509 --> 00:01:52.178
THIS ACT OF THIEVERY

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:53.579
WOULD DISHONOR HIS GODS.
- HEY, MAN.

00:01:53.612 --> 00:01:57.650
THE ONLY GODS
IS MONEY AND BITCHES, DUDE.

00:01:57.683 --> 00:02:01.754
- AH! I ACCEPT KANYE
THE GIANT'S GODS, AND, UH...

00:02:01.787 --> 00:02:03.723
YEAH, I-I-I STEAL
SOME OF THE MONEY TOO.

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:06.192
- YOU TOO?

00:02:06.225 --> 00:02:09.162
OKAY, WOULD YOU NOW LIKE
TO CONTINUE YOUR QUEST

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:11.564
FOR THE LANDS OF CALDAHAR?
- FELLAS...

00:02:11.597 --> 00:02:13.332
WE CAME HERE
FOR BITCHES.

00:02:13.365 --> 00:02:14.901
WHERE THE BITCHES AT?

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:18.471
- ALL RIGHT, YOU SEE A BEVY
OF WELL-ENDOWED WENCHES.

00:02:18.504 --> 00:02:22.375
- GREAT, I GRAB THEM BITCHES,
AND WE ALL GO IN MY SUV.

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:26.179
- FINE. KANYE THE GIANT,
UDAR THE DWARF,

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:28.814
AND GOLLIN THE CLERIC
CLIMB INTO HIS SUV

00:02:28.847 --> 00:02:32.251
WITH THEIR BITCHES
AND THEIR ILL-GOTTEN GAINS.

00:02:32.284 --> 00:02:33.553
- AND OUR ALIZE.

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:36.289
PLUS KANYE THE GIANT
PUTS HIS DEMO CD

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:37.957
IN THE CD PLAYER--
- NO, HE DOESN'T.

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:39.959
THERE ARE NO CDs
IN THIS WORLD!

00:02:39.992 --> 00:02:41.761
YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:02:41.794 --> 00:02:44.297
DO WHATEVER
YOU WANT.

00:02:48.867 --> 00:02:50.303
- ALL RIGHT.

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:52.505
I GUESS I'M
THE DUNGEON MASTER NOW.

00:02:52.538 --> 00:02:53.940
THE EYE OF ONA
OPENS UP...

00:02:55.641 --> 00:02:57.643
16 TITTIES
FALL OUT.

00:02:57.676 --> 00:02:59.512
- YEAH! [laughing]
- HURRAH!

